From 631e76c752e7c915a4f03245bd57a046862c68d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jihong Min <hurryman2212@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 08:17:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 22/33] net: airoha: add flowtable-aware SOE Ethernet and PPE
 support

Pass flowtable context through the Airoha offload callbacks and add the
Ethernet, QDMA, and PPE state and data paths required for autonomous SOE
XFRM flow offload.

Update the callback declaration, provider, and callers atomically so
intermediate revisions remain buildable.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Signed-off-by: Jihong Min <hurryman2212@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c  |  930 +++++++++++++++--
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h  |   44 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c  | 1132 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 include/linux/soc/airoha/airoha_offload.h |   16 +-
 4 files changed, 1972 insertions(+), 150 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
index b9a5c36..267d5f0 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@
 #include <linux/tcp.h>
